<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you for your continued partnership with National Funding and your recent request regarding your loan.</font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Total Payoff Amount:<span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">		</span>$</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Total Payoff w/Discount:<span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">		</span>$</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Discount Dates:&nbsp;<span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">			</span>[DATES]</div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Payments may be wired to the following:</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Bank Name:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Wells Fargo Bank</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Wire routing number:&nbsp; &nbsp; <span style="white-space:pre">	</span>121000248</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Account Number:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 4128605235</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Account Name:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>National Funding, Inc.</div><div><br></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><i style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">If your payoff funds are not paid from the business account on file with National Funding, please provide the bank name, account owner, and whether this is a business or personal account, to help us accurately apply funds to your balance when received</i></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><p class="MsoNormal">When paying off your loan early, you will need to wait 30 days before obtaining additional funding from National Funding.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal">Please contact our servicing department at 800-294-1702 if you have further questions.</p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Thank you,&nbsp;</div><div style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">Payoff Department</font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial"><b>National Funding</b></font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</span></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</span></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;">P: (800) 294-1702 | F: (888) 279-7564</span></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;">E: payoff@nationalfunding.com</span></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
